            "U",
            "On the appointed day, before a crowd gathered in the public square, tradition holds that Anthony emerged with the Blessed Sacrament. He addressed the starving animal directly: <i>\"In the name of your Creator, whom I, unworthy as I am, hold in my hands, I command you to come forward and pay reverence.\"</i> Bonovillo then set fodder before the mule."
