            "U",
            "The episode is recorded not only in <i>L'Assidua</i> but in the <i>Benignitas</i>, another of the earliest surviving lives of the saint. By medieval hagiographic standards, this places it among the better-attested Eucharistic traditions associated with a named and thoroughly documented saint."
